      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双涡轮讨巧克力的对象是也文摄辉，\n她是双涡轮的同期，是一位活跃于短距离路线，\n像风一样的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff10a7a11b72beb71eae4c558b70db87b9293d00b2b4d13d890e8028107dd205",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
