      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她可能是想开玩笑。\n而且因为是巧克力车，写“感械”也没错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dd0501722a1471bce2c9e88416c3fbd90b3a4598862870bf430e8889a284ed1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
